1. { -KEY- } Rxd7 $4 Kxd7 2. Kg6 ( { At this point I was just waiting for } 2. Kg6 Ke8 3. Kg7 Be5 4. b8=Q { but Black wisely assigned his defensive tasks in a different way. } ) 
Bd6 $1 ( { Draw agreed in view of } 3... Kc7 { next. } ) 

